Port of _patches/typescript/031-stability-tag-fast-path.patch (tsc/internal/ast/nodeflags.go, ast/tokenflags.go,
parser/jsdoc.go, parser/parser.go, scanner/scanner.go) to tsrs.

- NodeFlagsPossiblyContainsStabilityTag: NodeFlags::PossiblyContainsStabilityTag (1 << 29).
- TokenFlagsPrecedingJSDocWithStability: TokenFlags::PrecedingJSDocWithStability (1 << 19).
- jsdocScannerInfoHasStability: JsdocScannerInfo::HasStability, between HasDeprecated and HasSeeOrLink as in Go.
- Scanner.HasPrecedingJSDocWithStabilityTag: Scanner::has_preceding_jsdoc_with_stability_tag;
  scan_jsdoc_comment_for_tags sets the token flag for a `@stability` tag and stops once all three flags are set.
- Parser.withJSDoc: with_jsdoc_worker sets the node flag in the deferred (TS) path and on eagerly parsed JSDoc.

Read by ets_typeparser's stability_of_declaration_tag (Go's stabilityOfDeclarationTag), which skips nodes without
the flag; its api_stability tests find no `@stability` tag without this patch.

